      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "FROM PLATE TO COMFORT",
        "heading": "A heavy meal asks your digestion to do five jobs at once.",
        "intro": "<p>Protein. Fats. Carbohydrates. Fiber. Lactose. One mixed meal can contain all five—and each one requires different digestive support.</p>",
