        "before_heading": "One meal. A lot to break down.",
        "before_text": "<p>Rich, complicated meals can sometimes leave you feeling bloated, gassy, overly full, or weighed down long after the last bite.</p>",
        "before_points": "<ul><li>Protein, fats, carbs, fiber, and dairy all require different digestive work</li><li>Mixed meals can be harder to handle than a single type of food</li><li>Occasional pressure, gas, and uncomfortable fullness can follow</li></ul>",
        "after_tab": "With Avonent",
