        "after_image_alt": "Conceptual illustration of Avonent supporting mixed-meal digestion",
        "after_heading": "Support for the whole plate.",
        "after_text": "<p>Avonent combines five digestive enzymes to help break down protein, fats, carbohydrates, fiber, and lactose—plus artichoke, ox bile, slippery elm, and targeted botanicals for more complete digestive support.</p>",
        "after_points": "<ul><li>Broad enzyme support for every part of a mixed meal</li><li>Additional support for normal fat digestion and bile activity</li><li>Designed to support post-meal comfort and help with occasional bloating</li></ul>",
        "process_heading": "How Avonent supports the process",
        "closing_heading": "Made for real meals. Not perfect diets.",
        "closing_text": "<p>Protein-heavy lunches. Restaurant dinners. Dairy. Takeout nights. Avonent provides broader digestive support for the food you actually eat.</p>",
